## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| API not ready (Phase 5 incomplete) | Use mock data for initial development. Wire real API when Phase 5 ships. |
| Chart library mismatch | Use same charting approach as existing dashboard (check page.tsx for pattern). |
| New pages break existing layout | Test full sidebar + navigation before committing. |
